#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:4
msgid "UDF User Guide"
msgstr "UDF 用户指南"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"A user-defined function (UDF) is a Python function for cleaning data, "
"applying business rules, or calling a model in a MaxFrame job. Functions "
"such as ``map``, ``apply``, or ``apply_chunk`` apply the UDF to the data."
msgstr ""
"UDF（用户自定义函数）是用于处理数据的 Python 函数，可以用来清洗数据、处理业务规则或调用模型。写好后，通过 "
"``map``、``apply``、``apply_chunk`` 等函数，就可以在 MaxFrame 作业中使用它。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Use built-in expressions, string methods, or aggregations for calculations "
"they already support. Use a UDF for custom logic or calls to a third-party "
"library."
msgstr "内置表达式、字符串方法或聚合函数能够完成的计算，优先直接使用。需要自定义处理逻辑或调用第三方库时，再使用 UDF。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"Start with :ref:`udf_quick_start`, then see :ref:`udf_select_function` and "
":ref:`udf_examples` for other use cases."
msgstr ""
"可以先运行 :ref:`udf_quick_start`，再参考 :ref:`udf_select_function` 和 "
":ref:`udf_examples` 了解其他用法。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"To run a job against a MaxCompute table, follow :ref:`udf_complete_example`."
" See :ref:`udf_configuration_guide` for resources and dependencies."
msgstr ""
"在 MaxCompute 表上运行的完整流程见 :ref:`udf_complete_example`，资源和依赖包的设置见 "
":ref:`udf_configuration_guide`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:20
msgid "For slow jobs or memory pressure, see :doc:`udf_tuning`."
msgstr "作业较慢或内存不足时，参见 :doc:`udf_tuning`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"To inspect remote logs or step through a function locally, see "
":doc:`debugging`. For errors and incorrect results, see :doc:`faqs`."
msgstr "查看远程日志或在本地逐步调试函数，参见 :doc:`debugging`。遇到报错或结果不对，参见 :doc:`faqs`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:28
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"The following example converts two response-time values to numbers. The "
"function parses the ``ms`` suffix and returns a missing value for "
"``timeout``. Set the MaxCompute credentials, project, and endpoint in the "
"environment variables used below before running the example."
msgstr ""
"下面的例子将两条响应耗时转换为数值：函数去掉 ``ms`` 后缀，将 ``timeout`` 转为缺失值。运行前，先设置代码中使用的 "
"MaxCompute 凭证、项目和 Endpoint 环境变量。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:69
msgid "Core concepts"
msgstr "基本概念"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:71
msgid ""
"A *chunk* is one partition of a MaxFrame object. A *batch* is the rows "
"passed to one UDF call; one chunk can be processed in several batches. An "
"execution *task* processes data assigned by the engine and can handle one or"
" more chunks. MaxFrame supports three execution engines: ``DPE`` "
"(distributed Python workers), ``MCSQL`` (MaxCompute SQL execution), and "
"``SPE`` (single-process Python execution)."
msgstr ""
"*chunk* 是 MaxFrame 对象的一个数据分片。*batch* 是一次 UDF 调用收到的数据，一个 chunk 可以分多批处理。执行 "
"*task* 处理引擎分配的数据，可以包含一个或多个 chunk。MaxFrame 支持三种执行引擎：``DPE`` （分布式 Python "
"执行）、``MCSQL`` （MaxCompute SQL 执行）和 ``SPE`` （单进程 Python 执行）。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:78
msgid "DPE data flow from a table through chunks and tasks to UDF batches"
msgstr "DPE 中数据从表经过分块、任务到 UDF 批次的处理过程"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:78
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/task-batch-model.svg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/task-batch-model.svg\n"
"   :alt: DPE 中数据从表经过分块、任务到 UDF 批次的处理过程"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:82
msgid ""
"The diagram describes DPE. A chunk boundary is not part of the UDF's "
"contract; batch sizes can change between executions. See :ref:`udf_tuning` "
"for the settings and their engine-specific behavior."
msgstr ""
"图中描述的是 DPE。UDF 不应依赖固定的分块边界，同一作业每次执行时，批次大小也可能变化。相关配置和不同引擎的行为见 "
":ref:`udf_tuning`。"

