#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/index.rst:136
msgid ""
"Use a decorator for one UDF and ``options`` for shared defaults. See "
":doc:`udf_configuration` for engine support, common combinations, and "
"precedence. The :doc:`UDF API reference <../../reference/udf>` lists "
"complete signatures and parameters. See :doc:`elastic_memory` for DPE CPU "
"UDF retries after OOM. Before running a UDF, declare its output columns, "
"dtypes, and index as described in :ref:`udf_result_types`."
msgstr ""
"单个 UDF 使用装饰器配置，多个 UDF 共用的默认值通过 ``options`` 设置。引擎支持范围、常用组合和覆盖关系见 "
":doc:`udf_configuration`。完整签名和参数见 :doc:`UDF API 参考 "
"<../../reference/udf>`。DPE CPU UDF 在 OOM 后扩容重试的用法见 "
":doc:`elastic_memory`。运行前还需要声明输出列、数据类型和索引，具体见 :ref:`udf_result_types`。"

